      "date": "2026-05-14T11:31:23.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend reduced to ₹2.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.00 is 20% lower than last year. Ex-date: 10th June 2026 Payment date: 20th July 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.9%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (14% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (41% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 12% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to decline by 85% to shift the payout ratio to a potentially unsustainable range, which is more than the 4.9% EPS decline seen over the last 5 years.",
